✅ CERTAIN cards: Play immediately with confidence!
⚠️ SAFE BET cards: Calculated risks worth taking (especially rank 1s)
⚠️ MAYBE PLAYABLE: Verify against fireworks before playing
❌ RISKY/TOO RISKY: Don't play - give hints or discard instead

